  "source": "Pasta Board",
  "revision_id": "AHj4eMSXPuQFijszlY3b1enu8ewUkm1Yi5r31pl4Gl48R-R16m7gwWZBgV5QutG6_QvebsuVOXzBUwBK-F_9Cg",
  "classification": "original_source_text",
  "speaker_attribution": "Not inferred; the document does not consistently label speakers or exact times.",
  "full_source": "/archive/source.html",
  "previous": "/archive/passages/p-24569.md",
  "next": null,
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "p-31164",
      "text": "Aim for the quality of a polished OpenAI-adjacent research instrument.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31164"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31235",
      "text": "Beautiful, calm, minimal UI.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31235"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31264",
      "text": "Exceptional typography and spacing.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31264"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31300",
      "text": "Mobile-first, desktop-excellent.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31300"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31333",
      "text": "Light theme with restrained accents.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31333"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31370",
      "text": "Accessible, responsive interactions.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31370"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31407",
      "text": "Carefully designed interactive simulations.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31407"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31451",
      "text": "Expandable explanations and assumptions.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31451"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31492",
      "text": "Clear distinction between evidence and speculation.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31492"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31544",
      "text": "Excellent navigation for both humans and AI agents.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31544"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31596",
      "text": "No excessive animation, decorative clutter, or marketing hype.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31596"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31659",
      "text": "The existing billing mockup from our conversation should inform the visual direction.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31659"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31745",
      "text": "Do not impersonate OpenAI or suggest the website is an official OpenAI product.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31745"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31825",
      "text": "6. Commercial Rigor",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31825"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31845",
      "text": "Build an interactive economic comparison of:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31845"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31890",
      "text": "Existing fixed subscription tiers.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31890"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31925",
      "text": "A hypothetical additional $50 tier.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31925"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31961",
      "text": "$20 base + metered consumption.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31961"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-31993",
      "text": "Metered consumption with rounding-down discounts.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-31993"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32043",
      "text": "Hybrid pricing with loyalty privileges.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32043"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32083",
      "text": "Allow users to vary consumption, pricing, discounts, inference costs, and retention assumptions.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32083"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32180",
      "text": "Distinguish:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32180"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32193",
      "text": "Revenue.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32193"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32202",
      "text": "Gross profit.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32202"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32216",
      "text": "Customer lifetime value.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32216"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32241",
      "text": "Contribution margin.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32241"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32262",
      "text": "Churn.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32262"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32269",
      "text": "Credit exposure.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32269"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32286",
      "text": "Partnership upside.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32286"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32306",
      "text": "Clearly label simulated numbers as assumptions.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32306"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32354",
      "text": "The point is to make the ideas testable, not to claim they are already commercially proven.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32354"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32446",
      "text": "7. Editorial Philosophy",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32446"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32470",
      "text": "Preserve my recognizable intellectual voice.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32470"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32515",
      "text": "I prefer philosophical compression, unconventional but precise terminology, first-principles thinking, and concise declarations.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32515"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32644",
      "text": "Examples:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32644"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32654",
      "text": "Loyalty should compound.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32654"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32679",
      "text": "Relationship building is bidirectional.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32679"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32719",
      "text": "Customer Lifetime Value → Relationship Lifetime Value;",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32719"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32774",
      "text": "Follow this principle:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32774"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32797",
      "text": "Correct grammatical friction, not stylistic eccentricity.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32797"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32855",
      "text": "However, do not sacrifice intellectual rigor or usability merely to imitate my writing.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32855"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32943",
      "text": "8. Licensing and Attribution",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32943"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-32972",
      "text": "I want this work to be genuinely open.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-32972"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33011",
      "text": "Propose an appropriate permissive license or public-domain dedication for the original concepts and written material, plus an appropriate license for the website’s source code.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33011"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33188",
      "text": "Distinguish my contributions from third-party quotes, brands, screenshots, and intellectual property.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33188"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33290",
      "text": "I am comfortable with OpenAI considering, adapting, or implementing these ideas without owing me compensation.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33290"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33401",
      "text": "Present the work as an independent personal contribution, not official OpenAI guidance.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33401"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33489",
      "text": "9. Deliverables",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33489"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33505",
      "text": "Build the actual website, not just a concept description.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33505"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33563",
      "text": "Provide:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33563"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33572",
      "text": "A working responsive website.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33572"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33602",
      "text": "Interactive billing and commercial simulations.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33602"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33650",
      "text": "A navigable, inspectable research archive.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33650"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33693",
      "text": "A clear executive summary.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33693"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33720",
      "text": "Source code and deployment instructions.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33720"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33761",
      "text": "A production-ready public sharing option where supported.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33761"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33819",
      "text": "A short, friendly DM I can send Tibo with the link.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33819"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33871",
      "text": "Use available development tools and deploy where possible with my authorization.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33871"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33952",
      "text": "10. Execution Requirements",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33952"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-33979",
      "text": "First, inspect the conversation and create a complete intellectual inventory.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-33979"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34057",
      "text": "Then design the information architecture.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34057"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34099",
      "text": "Then implement the website.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34099"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34127",
      "text": "Then check:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34127"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34139",
      "text": "Factual accuracy.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34139"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34157",
      "text": "Source completeness.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34157"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34178",
      "text": "Mathematical correctness.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34178"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34204",
      "text": "Mobile usability.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34204"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34222",
      "text": "Navigation.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34222"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34234",
      "text": "Interaction functionality.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34234"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34261",
      "text": "Licensing clarity.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34261"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34280",
      "text": "Readability for Tibo.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34280"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34302",
      "text": "Don’t ask me to re-explain decisions already established in the conversation.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34302"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34380",
      "text": "Make reasonable implementation decisions independently.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34380"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34436",
      "text": "Treat the original conversation as the corpus, this prompt as the project specification, and the final website as an enduring, openly reusable contribution.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34436"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34593",
      "text": "The objective: Produce something so thoughtfully organized and useful that Tibo can understand the entire idea, inspect the reasoning, and explore the possibilities without needing another meeting.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34593"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34791",
      "text": "One recommendation before you move threads",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34791"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34834",
      "text": "I’d make the homepage an invitation to explore, not a claim that you’ve solved AI pricing.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34834"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34925",
      "text": "Something like:",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34925"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-34941",
      "text": "An independent exploration of how AI-native subscription relationships might evolve from consumption-based pricing into compounding loyalty, mutual trust, and eventually economic partnership.An open contribution. Take what is useful.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-34941"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-35175",
      "text": "And I’d preserve your original sentiment when you DM Tibo: I’ve explored this idea as far as I could, and I’d love for you and the team to have it.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-35175"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-35323",
      "text": "The website should do the explaining. Your DM should be short, generous, and entirely without pressure.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-35323"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-35427",
      "text": "That combination is much more compelling than another pitch.",
      "source_url": "/archive/source.html#p-35427"
    }
  ]
}
